<title>USA: Walt Disney Co sets reg qtly payout.</title>
<headline>Walt Disney Co sets reg qtly payout.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK, Calif. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney Co Monday declared a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.11 a share, payable November 22, to shareholders of record at the close of business October 11.</p>
</text>
